      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p01075",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "问：我在那张书桌的抽屉里珍藏着一束信件——",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Question: I have kept a bundle of letters treasured in the drawer of that desk—",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p01075",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "不过这跟忙碌的诸位没什么关系。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "But that has nothing to do with all of you busy people.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p01075",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "我们幽灵界马上就进入黄昏了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Our ghostly realm will soon enter twilight.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p01075",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "我要和各位诀别。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I must take my final leave of you all.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p01075",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "再见，各位。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Goodbye, everyone.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p01075",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "再见，善良的各位。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Goodbye, kind people.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
